    {
      "id": "u_f6fd2b8eb2af485fdefe505f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium uses a progressive search strategy that performs exact matching first, then adds fuzzy matching when needed.",
      "sourceHash": "f6fd2b8eb2af485fdefe505fc29f9dbf27b9e693841365e3178bfde3ba85d0c4",
      "context": "Under the hood > Progressive Search Strategy",
      "contextHash": "a2e76b91c5ace229e120ef1a53448d092f384ae4a28419ed954d195353a0b978",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumは、最初に完全一致を実行し、必要に応じてファジー一致を追加するプログレッシブ検索戦略を採用しています。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_caaee786d8a95efb43fe97ab_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The search has three phases:",
      "sourceHash": "caaee786d8a95efb43fe97ab14e5670f0e4977efe133357eea454af1dc88fa3c",
      "context": "Under the hood > Progressive Search Strategy",
      "contextHash": "a2e76b91c5ace229e120ef1a53448d092f384ae4a28419ed954d195353a0b978",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "検索には3つのフェーズがあります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e0b7bad54b27b56f226185f4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Phase 1 - Exact Matching__TRILIUM_PH_1__: When you search, Trilium first looks for exact matches of your search terms. This handles the vast majority of searches (90%+) and returns results almost instantly.",
      "sourceHash": "e0b7bad54b27b56f226185f407b82fc1ebd41c6176b75e806acf62c6f9a5b830",
      "context": "Under the hood > Progressive Search Strategy",
      "contextHash": "a2e76b91c5ace229e120ef1a53448d092f384ae4a28419ed954d195353a0b978",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__フェーズ1 - 完全一致__TRILIUM_PH_1__：検索を行うと、Triliumはまず検索用語の完全一致を探します。これにより、大半の検索（90%以上）が処理され、結果がほぼ瞬時に返されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_730c5e5170b58a9810108c63_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Phase 2 - Fuzzy Fallback__TRILIUM_PH_1__: If Phase 1 doesn't find enough high-quality results (fewer than 5 results with good relevance scores), Trilium automatically adds fuzzy matching to find results with typos or spelling variations.",
      "sourceHash": "730c5e5170b58a9810108c63f0a4a61cb462fced3d01135f1c83b804bd9eb6b8",
      "context": "Under the hood > Progressive Search Strategy",
      "contextHash": "a2e76b91c5ace229e120ef1a53448d092f384ae4a28419ed954d195353a0b978",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__フェーズ2 - ファジーフォールバック__TRILIUM_PH_1__：フェーズ1で十分な高品質の結果が見つからない場合（関連性スコアの高い結果が5件未満の場合）、Triliumは自動的にファジー一致を追加し、タイポやスペルのバリエーションがある結果を見つけます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_60e4dfef16dc497d53dc242d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Result Ordering__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Exact matches always appear before fuzzy matches, regardless of individual scores. This ensures that when you search for \"project\", notes containing the exact word \"project\" will appear before notes containing similar words like \"projects\" or \"projection\".",
      "sourceHash": "60e4dfef16dc497d53dc242da44e664b642650c99cd387ba3c6148f9b2f08ec3",
      "context": "Under the hood > Progressive Search Strategy",
      "contextHash": "a2e76b91c5ace229e120ef1a53448d092f384ae4a28419ed954d195353a0b978",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__結果の順序付け__TRILIUM_PH_1__：個別のスコアに関係なく、完全一致は常にファジー一致の前に表示されます。これにより、「project」を検索した際、「projects」や「projection」のような類似の単語を含むノートよりも、完全な単語「project」を含むノートが先に表示されるようになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
