    {
      "id": "u_a1e71fb40fd3e92b473d31cb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium detects the separation between full text search and attribute/property search by looking for certain special characters or words that denote attributes and properties (e.g., #, ~, note.). If you need to include these in full-text search, escape them with a backslash so they are processed as regular text:",
      "sourceHash": "a1e71fb40fd3e92b473d31cbfae536d694399a96100f50d0ca3e9391e24183bd",
      "context": "Under the hood > Separating Full-Text and Attribute Parts",
      "contextHash": "29a5f532c174201bb48fd89a5854fcbcccea5af551021398eef8a3bf770ebcd8",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Trilium は、属性やプロパティを示す特定の特殊文字や単語（#、~、note. など）を探すことで、全文検索と属性/プロパティ検索の境界を検出します。これらを全文検索に含める必要がある場合は、バックスラッシュでエスケープして通常のテキストとして処理されるようにします:",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
